      "message": "I\u0027m generally not in favor of importing bits of another API as though they come from this module. It\u0027s not clear as a user of strict_abc that abstractmethod comes from the abc module, which means you end up having to document and support it. \n\nIf you ever end up wanting a different abstractmethod implementation later, you would be locked in to this version\u0027s API anyway.",
